#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Perl"
msgstr "Instalação do Perl"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:46
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Perl for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare o Perl para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:48
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">sh Configure -des                                         \\\n"
"             -D prefix=/usr                               \\\n"
"             -D vendorprefix=/usr                         \\\n"
"             -D useshrplib                                \\\n"
"             -D privlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl     \\\n"
"             -D archlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl     \\\n"
"             -D sitelib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl     \\\n"
"             -D sitearch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl    \\\n"
"             -D vendorlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl \\\n"
"             -D vendorarch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">sh Configure -des                                         \\\n"
"             -D prefix=/usr                               \\\n"
"             -D vendorprefix=/usr                         \\\n"
"             -D useshrplib                                \\\n"
"             -D privlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl     \\\n"
"             -D archlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/core_perl     \\\n"
"             -D sitelib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl     \\\n"
"             -D sitearch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/site_perl    \\\n"
"             -D vendorlib=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl \\\n"
"             -D vendorarch=/usr/lib/perl5/&perl-version-min;/vendor_perl</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:60
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the Configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das opções do Configure:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:63
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-des</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-des</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:65
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This is a combination of three options: -d uses defaults for all items; -e "
"ensures completion of all tasks; -s silences non-essential output."
msgstr ""
"Essa é uma combinação de três opções: -d usa padrões para todos os itens; -e"
" assegura completamento de todas as tarefas; -s silencia saída gerada não "
"essencial."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:72
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D vendorprefix=/usr</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-D vendorprefix=/usr</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:74
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This ensures <command>perl</command> knows how to tell packages where they "
"should install their Perl modules."
msgstr ""
"Isso garante que <command>perl</command> saiba como dizer aos pacotes onde "
"eles deveriam instalar os módulos \"Perl\" deles."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D useshrplib</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-D useshrplib</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:82
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build <systemitem class='library'>libperl</systemitem> needed by some Perl "
"modules as a shared library, instead of a static library."
msgstr ""
"Construa a <systemitem class='library'>libperl</systemitem>, necessária para"
" alguns módulos \"Perl\", como uma biblioteca compartilhada, em vez de uma "
"biblioteca estática."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D privlib,-D archlib,-D sitelib,...</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>-D privlib,-D archlib,-D sitelib,...</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"These settings define where Perl looks for installed modules. The LFS "
"editors chose to put them in a directory structure based on the MAJOR.MINOR "
"version of Perl (&perl-version-min;) which allows upgrading Perl to newer "
"patch levels (the patch level is the last dot separated part in the full "
"version string like &perl-version;) without reinstalling all of the modules."
msgstr ""
"Essas configurações definem onde o \"Perl\" procura os módulos instalados. "
"Os(As) editores(as) do LFS optaram por colocá-los em uma estrutura de "
"diretórios baseada na versão PRINCIPAL.SECUNDÁRIA do \"Perl\" (&perl-"
"version-min;) que permite atualizar o \"Perl\" para níveis de remendo mais "
"recentes (o nível de remendo é a última parte separada por pontos na "
"sequência completa de caracteres da versão, como &perl-version;) sem "
"reinstalar todos os módulos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:104
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter07/perl.xml:108
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"

